ine;portConstraint=eastwest;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2585" y="7682" width="10" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v1" value="SCENARIO   Stage 3 build created by Main.createGame(): tables 1 and 2; menu Salad 900 cents / 1 prep unit, Burger 1500 / 1, Pasta 1800 / 2, Salad + Pasta Combo 2430 / 3; base arrivals Regular #1 (turn 1), VIP #2 (4), Regular #3 (7), Critic #4 (10), Regular #5 (13), Regular #6 (16).   Focal customer c1 = RegularCustomer #1 (loses 8 satisfaction per waiting turn, pays full price); it orders Salad because chooseItem() takes menu index (1 - 1) mod 4 = 0.&lt;br&gt;MANAGER CHOICE: at the start of turn 2, answer yes (activate Happy Hour) or no.   Outcome that changes: c1 is recorded at 100 satisfaction instead of 92, which decides VICTORY vs DEFEAT at the result check (both branches verified by replaying the game).   Each controller action first checks the private requirePhase(expected) guard (drawn once, in message 23)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=10;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="99" width="2805" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e2" value="1. run()" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=8;curved=0;rounded=0;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="130" y="158" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="330" y="158" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="fr3" value="" style="shape=umlFrame;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;pointerEvents=0;recursiveResize=0;container=0;collapsible=0;width=40;height=20;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#444444;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="182" width="2825" height="7720" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v4" value="loop" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;f